WEBVTT

00:01:54.921 --> 00:02:00.149
And the Treasury is getting that money
to, mostly, Americans,

00:02:00.173 --> 00:02:04.585
in some imperfect
but remarkably large way.

00:02:04.609 --> 00:02:07.481
And the Europeans are doing the same

00:02:07.505 --> 00:02:08.759
in their way.

00:02:08.783 --> 00:02:10.942
That bank is a smaller bank,

00:02:10.966 --> 00:02:14.601
because the world lives
with about 70 percent dollars,

00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:16.188
and only a small percent euro,

00:02:16.212 --> 00:02:18.958
and they will produce theirs for theirs,

00:02:18.982 --> 00:02:21.537
and there aren't many banks
around the world.

00:02:21.561 --> 00:02:24.632
And so the rest of the world

00:02:24.656 --> 00:02:28.482
is going to have gaps,
holes that won't be filled.

00:02:28.847 --> 00:02:31.926
